zchangelog (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add an inotify collection backend for kernels without fanotify
    FID reporting, selected with watch -b inotify and used as the
    automatic fallback when FID reporting is unavailable.
  * Add the maint functional test covering the integrity check and
    the consumer listing.

